{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2L0phcmhlYWQlMjAzJTIwVGhlJTIwU2llZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDE2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Jarhead 3 The Siege","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/namZEDSMbFOSI3sMjzeSJ4E176o.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sr55z05MvFdCooDif7xbjmwJUU3.jpg","description":"Corporal Evan Albright joined the elite Marine Corps Security Guards to save the world and see some action-not necessarily in that order. But his first assignment, protecting a U. S. Embassy in a seemingly safe Middle Eastern capitol, relegates his unit to wrangling \"gate groupies\" protesting outside the compound and honing their marksmanship by playing video games. So Albright and his team are caught off guard when well-armed and well-trained militants launch a surprise attack aimed at killing an informant in the embassy. Heavily out-gunned, they will have to muster all the courage and fire power they can as their once routine assignment spirals into all-out war.\n\nRated R · Released 20 Jan 2016 · United States of America · Language: English · 95 min\nStudio: UFO International Productions, Universal 1440 Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["War","Action","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Scott Adkins","Sasha Jackson","Tom Ainsley","Dennis Haysbert","Charlie Weber","Dante Basco","Romeo","Erik Valdez"],"director":["William Kaufman"],"released":"2016-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"William Kaufman","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/a7cLQauPNw41xH06xfYx9tiCmVZ.jpg"},{"name":"Scott Adkins","character":"Gunny Raines","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9NRr2a1riIn5CWn5McZLJlk4vxR.jpg"},{"name":"Sasha Jackson","character":"Olivia Winston","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e1dVUW0ch27YdavOKI9F8XZwt1W.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Ainsley","character":"Hansen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p